# Frozen schema fingerprints — SimCrux trend store
#
# APPEND ONLY. One line per shipped schema version:
#   v<N>  <sha256 of the normalised sqlite_master dump at vN>
#
# Adding schema version N+1 adds ONE line here and changes
# none. If a diff to this file MODIFIES an existing line, a
# migration that has already shipped was edited — which means
# fresh installs and upgraded installs now disagree about the
# schema, silently, forever. Revert that edit and express the
# change as a new migration instead.
